-*   **Memory Complexity:** LPMs use high spatial resolution but coarse directional sampling for storage [S1]. This reduces memory compared to full DOM [S1]. Only two $U$ buffers are needed [S1].
-*   **Performance:** LPM reduces artifacts like false scattering and ray effects compared to standard DOM [S1].
